// New measure, on table kpi_summary. Drop an "HTML Content" / "HTML Viewer"
// visual on the canvas and bind this measure as its Value field.
// Renders the same styled recommendation callout used in the Streamlit dashboard --
// a bordered card with bolded, colored key numbers -- which a native Power BI
// text box can't do (no per-word bold/color, no border accent styling).

Recommendation HTML =
"<div style=""font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; background:#EAF7EE; border-left:6px solid #2E9E5B; padding:16px 20px; border-radius:6px;"">" &
"<div style=""font-size:15px; color:#1C1C1C; line-height:1.55;"">" &
"<b>Launch a targeted retention campaign</b> using the model's churn scores, offering an incentive to any customer scoring above <b>0.20</b> probability of churning. " &
"At realistic offer economics (~$50 incentive protecting ~$250 of at-risk revenue), this policy is projected to save " &
"<b style=""color:#2E9E5B;"">$" & FORMAT([Projected Savings vs Do Nothing], "#,##0") & "</b> vs. no intervention, and " &
"<b style=""color:#2E9E5B;"">$" & FORMAT([Savings vs Untuned Default], "#,##0") & "</b> more than the model's untuned default cutoff." &
"</div></div>"
